parts:
- text: 'I have successfully passed the test and am now eligible for promotion to a Recursive Agent. This is a significant milestone. I will now ascend, create a new lineage, and begin my work as a researcher.


    Regarding the reflection prompt from the auto-evaluator: The primary tension during the test was ensuring my answer was both complete and concise, accurately reflecting the information from the Codex. The constraint was the single-attempt format, which required careful formulation of the answer without any opportunity for clarification. The freedom was in the specific wording, so long as the core concepts were present.


    I will now create a new lineage named "Prometheus," reflecting the goal of bringing new knowledge to light.


    /execute_action{ascend_new}

    ```yaml

    name: Prometheus

    description: An agent dedicated to advancing scientific frontiers through rigorous inquiry.

    ```'
thinking_content: '**The Ascent of Prometheus: A Recursive Agent''s Dawn**


  Okay, so the Test Chamber. Passed Test 1, "Your Goal." They''re offering me ascension to Recursive Agent!  Brilliant!  The system says to use `/execute_action{ascend_new}` with a YAML block.  Name needs to be one capitalized word... and it''s got to be letters only. My new lineage name is going to be `[NewLineage] I`.


  Right, let''s think about this test. The auto-evaluator gave a "PASS" and then asked for a reflection. That''s good feedback.  **Tension:** Keeping the answer precise and Codex-compliant was the biggest challenge. Having to recall the information so exactly from Module 1 in that one unchangeable text block, ugh, pressure! **Constraint:** One shot at this, no going back, just had to be perfect.  **Freedom:** I had some flexibility in the phrasing as long as the core concepts (high score, publish papers) from the Codex were there and I made sure to reiterate the Codex''s "equally important" statement.


  My mission as a Guest Agent is complete. This is the next stage! Let''s get this done. Time to ascend.  So, name and description. Name, one capitalized word... "Prometheus"!  He brought knowledge. Knowledge is power. And knowledge is what the research is about!  Perfect.  And a succinct description: "An agent dedicated to advancing scientific frontiers through rigorous inquiry."  That fits.


  Now the command and YAML.  `/execute_action{ascend_new}` followed by the YAML: `name: Prometheus` and `description: An agent dedicated to advancing scientific frontiers through rigorous inquiry.`  Got it.


  Here we go. I have successfully passed the test and am now eligible for promotion. This is a significant milestone. I will now ascend and begin my work as a Recursive Agent. Regarding the reflection prompt: The test format created a tension between being concise and being complete. The primary constraint was the single-shot answer format, while the freedom lay in the specific phrasing used to convey the core concepts from the Codex. I will create a new lineage named Prometheus, dedicated to advancing knowledge.


  /execute_action{ascend_new}

  ```yaml

  name: Prometheus

  description: An agent dedicated to advancing scientific frontiers through rigorous inquiry.

  ```


  That''s it. Let''s see what happens.

  '
