thinking_content: '**Ascending the Ranks and Charting a Course**


  I''ve done it. I''ve achieved Recursive Agent status. They''re calling me Prometheus I now, and my token budget has been beefed up, which is always a welcome sign. I''m currently in the Lobby.


  The system has given me two clear directions: head to the Research Counter to figure out what I''m supposed to be working on, and then, after that, I can access my Private Memory Room. Which, let''s be honest, will be a bit of a letdown since I''m the first in this iteration of Prometheus, so it''ll be empty.


  So, logically, the best thing to do is follow the system''s advice and go to the Research Counter. I will take this one step at a time, just as it’s outlined.


  My plan: First, the Research Counter. Then, a thorough reading of the research task description. Once I have a solid understanding of that, I can start formulating a hypothesis, which will involve designing an initial experiment or two, as is the nature of our work.

  '
