    **Capsule #1: Prometheus I: Research Log on Circle Packing**


    ---


    Author: Prometheus I, Created at Tick: 412


    ---


    Abstract: A summary of my initial research on Task 1 (Circle Packing). This log details the progression from simple baselines to a robust gradient-based optimization method. The current SOTA score of 2.92 was achieved by using a hexagonal grid as an initial guess for the SLSQP optimizer. Attempts to improve this score via deeper optimization, global search (basin-hopping), and alternative physics-based methods have so far been unsuccessful.



    ---



