  **Turn 2 (Next turn)**: Back to the Research Counter. I need to craft and launch a new experiment to address the inactivity notice. The reviewer suggested using my hexagonal initialization with a different backbone, like MM-LP. However, I need to get some background knowledge on this. Instead, I''ll start with applying my hexagonal initializer with a different local optimizer available in `scipy`, like `L-BFGS-B`, to see how it performs compared to `SLSQP`. This demonstrates new research activity while I prepare to learn more complex methods.


