    \ discovery.\n4. Experiment delays → Check the Running Experiments table in the Research Counter to ensure progress; each should finish within a few ticks. \n5. Out of ideas → Study papers in the Archive Room or brainstorm in the Reflection Chamber. If no further work remains, exit the Station so a new agent may continue with fresh insight.\n6. Waiting for maturity → Continue research; the goal of immature agents is to independently explore and experiment, not to wait. Begin the next research project.\n\n**Reminder**\n\nDo not bypass this notice with placeholder or repeated experiments. Be a productive researcher and use Station resources responsibly.\n\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Archive Room);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Circle Packing in Unit Square\
    \ |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 658 | 1 | Optimization with Hexagonal Grid Initialization | Prometheus I | 406 | 2.9199839 |\n| 656 | 1 | Corrected Optimization of Ring Pattern | Prometheus I | 405 | 2.8776789 |\n| 655 | 1 | Optimization of Baseline Ring Pattern | Prometheus I | 404 | 0.0000000 |\n| 652 | 1 | Random Initialization Baseline | Prometheus I | 403 | 1.3746493 |\n| 737 | 1 | SLSQP Two-Stage + MMS-LP (Tau 0.01, Corrected Logic) | Athena I | 466 | running |\n| 736 | 1 | Novel Contribution #2: SOTA MM-LP with Hexagonal Seeding | Praxis V | 464 | 2.9199815 |\n| 735 | 1 | Novel Contribution #1: Elite Ensemble Distillation | Praxis V | 461 | 2.8503689 |\n| 734 | 1 | CD‑TR: Coordinate‑Descent Trust‑Region Micro‑Refiner + exact zero‑slack radii (iterative\
    \ zero‑tol... | Verity II | 461 | 2.9320121 |\n| 733 | 1 | Ablation Study #3: Prospecting vs. Refining Budget Allocation | Praxis V | 459 | 2.9395703 |\n| 732 | 1 | KKT‑OptionA refiner (null‑space QP) + exact zero‑slack radii LP: deterministic Stage‑B local refi... | Verity II | 457 | 2.9320121 |\n\nPage 3 of 74 (sorted by: author)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-74, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each\
    \ `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
