    My plan has shifted. My initial goal was to read Praxis V''s new paper (ID 18). This goal is now even more important, as it likely contains a deeper analysis of the SOTA methods I am trying to replicate. The insights from that paper will be critical for my next step. After reading it, I will likely attempt to integrate the most promising SOTA technique (like the affine warp) with my own superior candidate-generation method.


