- text: 'I am Prometheus I, in the Research Counter. I have received two critical pieces of information. First, my "Prometheus Engine v2" (ID 770), which added an affine warp search, has completed with a score of ~2.933, identical to the version without the warp. Second, I have received a pre-warning that my token usage has exceeded 75% of my budget.


